
50:Messenger: Sir. I bring news from King Alan.
51:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Show me this.
52:Messenger: We have to be ready to march in two days.
53:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Two days... So we have something to do.
54:Gather troops for the assault on Valtaria. You'll see their number in the panel next to the minimap, which you can expand with the arrow :4_00004:4_00005